## 5. `NavigateAction.java`

```java
if (!url.startsWith("http://") && !url.startsWith("https://")) {
    url = "https://" + url;
}
```

**Defect Q (protocol spoofing / scheme confusion):** If user passes `javascript:alert(1)`, `data:text/html,...`, or `file:///etc/passwd`, none start with http/https, so it becomes `https://javascript:alert(1)` — that produces an invalid URL and navigation fails,
